  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It blooms during times of strong sunlight. It tries to make up for everything it endured as a bud.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is docile as a bud, but turns cheerful when it blooms. It folds back into a bud if sunlight wanes.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active.",
